BUILD OUTPUTS
==============

Intermediate and final binaries generated by the toolchain.

ROM FILES
---------
  777-p1.p1   68000 Program ROM (512 KB, padded to 2 MB)
  777-m1.m1   Z80 Sound Driver ROM (64 KB)
  777-v1.v1   ADPCM audio samples V ROM
  game.rom    Raw 68k binary (input to srec_cat padding)

OBJECT FILES
------------
  neogeo.o      SDK hardware init (built from sdk/neogeo.c)
  user.o        Game startup hooks (built from user.c)
  main.o        Main demo code (built from main.c)
  neogeolib.o   SDK library (built from sdk/neogeolib.c)

Clean: make clean        (removes game ROM + objects)
       make sound-clean  (removes M1, V ROM, encoded samples)
       make clean-all    (full clean including C ROMs)
